(
    title: "Miner 2049er",
    description: Some("Bounty Bob works an abandoned uranium mine, and the floor turns solid behind him: you must walk every section of the framework to claim a station, and missing one section blocks the way out. Mutants kill on contact until you pick up a miner\'s lost possession, which turns them briefly edible. A timer runs throughout and pays out whatever is left."),
